91_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gvAH8aEQfhEQ7kNvwGR31Et&_nc_oc=AdmQoB7kIVIlMELNkI4tGvCXpgXstVFkDBvwyHVqDSFPR4ipZCnlHbt5taxbED4PjpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfugwtvYDVIcQwdF8CGi0R4-yX66QYQrqad9aZOpTyM0dA&oe=6999B38F"}, {"file_name": "Fros Screenshot 4.png", "id": "602119818987796", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035428_602119822321129_2322577598304621698_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rVM1b90tBwsQ7kNvwFWM3Vi&_nc_oc=AdlNXOW1Gizi4K3Bok04LImwunsIP6DRCCpKgX17cTdYTikqjxrJvWFegy-EEPCNFUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftIE_R6hYETHMklkYFynNxB_pBSfv_24LmpV9TOog3VZA&oe=6999BC6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fros", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# LONG LIVE THE FROG KING!\n\n**Become a Fro and join your Frog bros in the ultimate battle for honor & glory!\ud83d\udc38**\n\nGrab your sword, flex your froggy thighs, and LEAP into the castle to claim the throne as the KING OF THE FROGS! \ud83d\udc51\n\n\u2728 Magic Spells\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Armor\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Swords\n\n\ud83c\udff9 Bow & Arrows\n\n\ud83e\udd87 Pets\n\n\ud83e\uddea Potions (coming soon)\n\nThe best Fro warriors will earn legendary weapons, shiny armor, and **the top warrior will be crowned King of the Frogs** in the discord!\n\nContests, Live events, & Rewards: https://discord.gg/jVZcZkxbwH", "short_description": "Join your **Frog Bros** to conquer the dungeon and defeat the snakes threatening the Kingdom! \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc51\u2694\ufe0f\n\nGrab your sword & magic to become the greatest Frog knight in the Kingdom of Lilymoor! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auravision.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aura Vision LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://auravision.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfor